Notebook[{Cell["ReplaceBindings", "ObjectName"], 
  Cell["ReplaceBindings is an option of BindModularForms: True replaces \
existing bindings of the given slots (the combined set is checked again).", 
   "Usage"], Cell["Status: Alpha.", "Notes"], 
  Cell["Option of BindModularForms: whether existing bindings of the given \
slots may be replaced.", "Notes"], Cell["False (default) fails AlreadyBound; \
